<% provide(:title, "Accessibility Statement (RGAA 4.1 / WCAG 2.1 AA)") %>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9">
      <h1 class="h2 mb-3">Accessibility Statement — RGAA 4.1 &amp; WCAG 2.1 AA</h1>
      <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">
        ShareMyBag Exchange is designed and continuously verified against the French <strong>RGAA 4.1</strong> standard and <strong>WCAG 2.1 Level AA</strong> so all passengers and airline operators can use every screen comfortably, including with keyboard-only navigation and screen readers.
      </p>

      <div class="d-grid gap-4">
        <section class="smb-card p-4">
          <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Key Accessibility Measures Implemented</h2>
          <ul class="text-muted small mb-0 d-grid gap-2">
            <li><strong>Language &amp; Landmarks (RGAA 8.3, 9.2, 12.7)</strong>: Explicit <code>lang="en"</code>, skip link directly to <code>#main-content</code>, semantic <code>header</code>, <code>nav[aria-label]</code>, <code>main</code>, <code>footer</code>, and a single <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> per page.</li>
            <li><strong>Accessible Financial &amp; Flight Data Tables (RGAA 5.6, 5.7)</strong>: Every flight table, Bid/Ask order book, and ROI breakdown uses semantic <code>&lt;table&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;caption&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;th scope="col"&gt;</code> headers.</li>
            <li><strong>Color Contrast &amp; Non-Color Cues (RGAA 3.1, 3.2, 3.3)</strong>: High-contrast palette (≥ 4.5:1 text, ≥ 3:1 UI borders/controls). Bid/Ask status never relies on color alone — explicit text labels (<code>BID</code>, <code>ASK</code>, <code>Open</code>, <code>Cutoff</code>) accompany every indicator.</li>
            <li><strong>Accessible Forms &amp; Live Calculators (RGAA 7.5, 11.1, 11.5, 11.10)</strong>: Explicit labels, <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>/<code>&lt;legend&gt;</code> grouping, <code>aria-required</code>, <code>aria-invalid</code>, focusable error summaries (<code>role="alert"</code>), and polite live regions (<code>aria-live="polite"</code>) for the live trade settlement preview and interactive Annual Fleet ROI Simulator.</li>
            <li><strong>Keyboard Focus &amp; Reduced Motion (RGAA 10.7)</strong>: High-visibility <code>:focus-visible</code> focus rings and full support for <code>prefers-reduced-motion: reduce</code>.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="smb-card p-4">
          <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Continuous Automated Testing</h2>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Every pull request is verified by automated integration tests covering language declarations, landmark structure, table headers, form error announcements, <code>aria-current="page"</code>, and live-region availability across all core routes.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
